// Windows resource script for MavUI.
//
// This file is compiled into the executable (CMakeLists.txt copies every entry of
// DEPLOY_WIN_FILES into ${CMAKE_BINARY_DIR}/deploy/windows and adds them to the target
// sources), so the icon path is relative to that copy directory - NOT to this file.
// QGC_WINDOWS_ICON_PATH is copied there too, under its own basename, which is why the
// name below has to match custom/deploy/windows/MavUI.ico exactly. The upstream file
// this replaces pointed at "./WindowsQGC.ico" and only ever showed the AURA icon by the
// accident of the custom icon carrying the same filename as the stock one.
//
// VERSIONINFO is deliberately absent: Qt generates its own resource from the
// QT_TARGET_* properties set in CMakeLists.txt (company, product, copyright, version),
// and declaring it twice makes the resource compiler fail.

IDI_ICON1    ICON    DISCARDABLE     "./MavUI.ico"
